{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 54,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        526.7271728515625,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "The only product for which eligible data met the class-based performance criteria for LC-mNAATs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        521.3412475585938,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "is Loopamp MTBC Detection Kit (TB LAMP) (Eiken Chemical, Tokyo, Japan) for pulmonary TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        108.66522979736328,
        526.9368286132812,
        121.81022644042969
      ],
      "text": "Regulatory approval from national regulatory authorities or other relevant bodies is required",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        124.16522979736328,
        526.8363647460938,
        137.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "before implementation of this diagnostic test. Extrapolation to other brand-specific tests cannot",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.946017265319824,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        139.66522216796875,
        527.0029296875,
        152.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "be made, and any new in-class technologies or new indications for the technology currently",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.16522216796875,
        497.5065612792969,
        168.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "included in the class will need to be evaluated by WHO PQ and WHO/GTB, respectively.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        179.16912841796875,
        526.99609375,
        192.3141326904297
      ],
      "text": "The publication   describes  WHO operational handbook on tuberculosis. Module 3: Diagnosis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.66912841796875,
        217.1636962890625,
        207.8141326904297
      ],
      "text": "the tests included in this class.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        220.1806182861328,
        192.72633361816406,
        236.5606231689453
      ],
      "text": "Recommendations",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.41439819335938,
        258.813720703125,
        513.3916625976562,
        271.72772216796875
      ],
      "text": "6.\t For adults and adolescents with signs or symptoms or who screen positive for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.25689697265625,
        274.313720703125,
        513.3900146484375,
        287.22772216796875
      ],
      "text": "pulmonary TB, low-complexity manual NAATs should be used on respiratory",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.25689697265625,
        289.813720703125,
        510.6324157714844,
        302.72772216796875
      ],
      "text": "samples as initial diagnostic tests for TB rather than smear microscopy or culture.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.25689697265625,
        308.18133544921875,
        360.4208068847656,
        321.06231689453125
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, high certainty of evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        343.4941101074219,
        120.02171325683594,
        357.58209228515625
      ],
      "text": "Remarks",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        368.28509521484375,
        78.81909942626953,
        381.43011474609375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        368.28509521484375,
        526.9774169921875,
        381.43011474609375
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation applies to all people living with HIV, with the caveat of low to moderate",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        383.78509521484375,
        526.9531860351562,
        396.93011474609375
      ],
      "text": "certainty of evidence. However, wherever available, concurrent testing with an LC-aNAAT",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        399.28509521484375,
        524.4561767578125,
        412.43011474609375
      ],
      "text": "and LF-LAM is recommended for people living with HIV. For more details, see Section 2.3.1.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        414.78509521484375,
        78.81909942626953,
        427.93011474609375
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        414.78509521484375,
        527.1846313476562,
        427.93011474609375
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation was extrapolated to children for use with respiratory samples",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        430.28509521484375,
        526.986083984375,
        443.43011474609375
      ],
      "text": "(including induced sputum and gastric aspirate) based on the generalization of data from",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        445.78509521484375,
        526.5792236328125,
        458.93011474609375
      ],
      "text": "adults and very limited data for children, acknowledging the difficulties of collecting sputum",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.964040756225586,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        461.28509521484375,
        526.9686279296875,
        474.43011474609375
      ],
      "text": "specimens from this population. However, wherever available, concurrent testing with an",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        476.78509521484375,
        526.9086303710938,
        489.93011474609375
      ],
      "text": "LC-aNAAT on a respiratory and stool samples is recommended for children. For more details,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.968905448913574,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        492.28509521484375,
        169.34329223632812,
        505.43011474609375
      ],
      "text": "see Section 2.3.2.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.78509521484375,
        78.81909942626953,
        520.9301147460938
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        507.78509521484375,
        526.9752807617188,
        520.9301147460938
      ],
      "text": "Data on the use of the test with paediatric stool samples were very limited, and there were",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        523.2850952148438,
        526.9971313476562,
        536.4301147460938
      ],
      "text": "no data on the use of nasopharyngeal aspirates. The recommendation was, therefore, not",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        538.7850952148438,
        259.5625305175781,
        551.9301147460938
      ],
      "text": "extrapolated to these sample types.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        554.2850952148438,
        78.81909942626953,
        567.4301147460938
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        554.2850952148438,
        524.4097900390625,
        567.4301147460938
      ],
      "text": "No recommendation was made on test use for extrapulmonary TB due to insufficient data.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        569.7850952148438,
        78.81909942626953,
        582.9301147460938
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        569.7850952148438,
        526.9752807617188,
        582.9301147460938
      ],
      "text": "As LC-mNAATs do not provide rifampicin-resistance results, all positive diagnostic tests for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        585.2850952148438,
        431.396240234375,
        598.4301147460938
      ],
      "text": "TB require follow-up and referral for DST for, at a minimum, rifampicin.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        613.6312866210938,
        239.91468811035156,
        630.0112915039062
      ],
      "text": "Justification and evidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        640.2623291015625,
        527.0047607421875,
        653.4073486328125
      ],
      "text": "WHO/GTB initiated an update of the previous guidelines and commissioned a systematic review",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        655.7623291015625,
        527.160400390625,
        668.9073486328125
      ],
      "text": "on the use of LC-mNAATs (TB LAMP) for the diagnosis of TB in people with signs and symptoms",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.97467041015625,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        671.2623291015625,
        257.2138977050781,
        684.4073486328125
      ],
      "text": "of TB, or who screened positive for TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        40.76240158081055,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "38 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}